ns executed on the Website will be deemed to be “in writing” and to have been “signed.”    User represents, warrants and covenants that all information provided by User to CommodityLogic is true, accurate and complete in all respects and that CommodityLogic shall be entitled to continue to rely on any information previously provided to it by User in connection with the execution of actions through the Website.

